WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.134 --> 00:00:19.968
Rat rowed and Mole watched the waves.

2
00:00:19.969 --> 00:00:23.257
Rat pointed to a rock near the bank.

3
00:00:23.258 --> 00:00:25.498
"Look!" said Rat.

4
00:00:25.499 --> 00:00:29.019
"That is where I caught my first fish."

5
00:00:29.020 --> 00:00:31.889
But Mole didn't hear him.

6
00:00:31.890 --> 00:00:35.982
He was too busy enjoying the river.

7
00:00:35.983 --> 00:00:40.103
"This is all new to me!" grinned Mole.

8
00:00:40.104 --> 00:00:44.353
"The river is my world," said Rat.

9
00:00:44.354 --> 00:00:47.562
"I don't want any other."

10
00:00:47.563 --> 00:00:51.843
"But it must be boring sometimes," said Mole.

11
00:00:51.844 --> 00:00:55.284
"Never!" said Rat.

12
00:00:55.285 --> 00:00:59.529
The river passed by some dark woods.

13
00:00:59.530 --> 00:01:03.459
"What's over there?" asked Mole.

14
00:01:03.460 --> 00:01:08.179
"That? It's the Wild Wood," said Rat.

15
00:01:08.180 --> 00:01:11.846
"We Riverbankers don't go there much."

16
00:01:11.847 --> 00:01:15.939
"Are folks nice there?" asked Mole.

17
00:01:15.940 --> 00:01:18.758
"The squirrels are all right.

18
00:01:18.759 --> 00:01:21.695
Some of the rabbits are nice too.

19
00:01:21.696 --> 00:01:27.273
But you can't trust the weasels!" said Rat.

20
00:01:27.274 --> 00:01:29.781
"Badger lives in the Wild Wood.

21
00:01:29.782 --> 00:01:31.630
He's my friend."

22
00:01:31.631 --> 00:01:35.840
"Let's go see Badger!" Mole cried.

23
00:01:35.841 --> 00:01:39.300
"That's not a good idea," said Rat.

24
00:01:39.301 --> 00:01:41.840
"Badger hates visitors."

25
00:01:41.841 --> 00:01:47.111
Rat and Mole paddled into a small pond.

26
00:01:47.112 --> 00:01:50.548
They tied up the boat and stepped out.

27
00:01:50.549 --> 00:01:52.517
Rat spread the blanket.

28
00:01:52.518 --> 00:01:54.802
He opened the basket.

29
00:01:54.803 --> 00:01:57.869
"Let's eat!" cried Rat.

30
00:01:57.870 --> 00:02:03.301
As they sat down, bubbles popped up on the water.

31
00:02:03.302 --> 00:02:07.742
The bubbles moved closer to shore.

32
00:02:07.743 --> 00:02:13.338
Splash! A new friend popped out of the water.

33
00:02:13.339 --> 00:02:21.839
"Hey! Why wasn't I invited?" laughed Otter.
